  "destination_plan": {
    "_doc": "Phase 2 (sdk-api-surface.md section 17, the destination plan table, ruling R8, R10). Inputs: flags, machine (null: no answer on SUPERBASED_NODE_URL within 500 ms; else signed_in and local_enabled), observer_on_path, tty, answer (what the person answers a question; null when none is asked), sdk_file (valid: a valid SDK-held file is present). want: plan (local, online, both, or null when setup stops), credential (device_flow: the online sign-in of section 13 of onboarding-v2-connect-flow.md; machine: Observer's own key; sdk_file: the file already held; none), approval (none, ask (a question on the terminal), enable_prompt (y/N on the terminal), enable_browser (opens <node_url>/apps?enable=1&from=setup and polls GET /api/apps/status every 2 s up to 5 minutes), browser (the device sign-in's approve_url)), writes_file, and exit when setup stops here (with message_contains). Every row with credential device_flow also has approval browser; a plan with both a device flow and an enable has approval enable_and_browser.",
